{"id":12270,"date":"2025-07-16T08:17:46","date_gmt":"2025-07-16T12:17:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/?page_id=12270"},"modified":"2025-10-22T09:15:54","modified_gmt":"2025-10-22T13:15:54","slug":"nf-e","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/documentos-fiscais-eletronicos\/nf-e\/","title":{"rendered":"NF-e"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"background:#004f9f;color:#ffffff;display:flex\" class=\"wp-block-my-theme-cabecalho-do-programa\"><div class=\"container\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><div class=\"cabecalho-do-programa-esquerdo\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/banner-NFe.png\" alt=\"Imagem pequena\" style=\"height:80px;margin-bottom:10px\"\/><h2 class=\"block-title\">NF-e<\/h2><h3 class=\"block-summary\">Nota Fiscal Eletr\u00f4nica<\/h3><\/div><div class=\"cabecalho-do-programa-direito\"><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#f9f9f9\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column secao2 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Programa-NF-e-1.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"592\" height=\"282\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Programa-NF-e-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14477\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Programa-NF-e-1.png 592w, https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Programa-NF-e-1-300x143.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 592px) 100vw, 592px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"Text2 has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-29ff446cf5b0b75960c32ad187b5ff1a\" style=\"color:#1d1d1b;font-size:24px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">O que \u00e9<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"Text2 has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-0ae12678cceaf583171d79f5cc8f5000\" style=\"color:#565654;font-size:16px\">A Nota Fiscal Eletr\u00f4nica (NF-e), modelo 55, \u00e9 o documento emitido e armazenado eletronicamente, de exist\u00eancia apenas digital, com o intuito de documentar opera\u00e7\u00f5es e presta\u00e7\u00f5es, cuja validade jur\u00eddica \u00e9 garantida por uma assinatura eletr\u00f4nica qualificada e pela autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o de uso concedida pela Secretaria de Estado de Fazenda (SEFAZ), antes da ocorr\u00eancia do fato gerador.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column secao2 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/banner-nfe-1.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"592\" height=\"282\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/banner-nfe-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14055\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/banner-nfe-1.png 592w, https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/banner-nfe-1-300x143.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 592px) 100vw, 592px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"Text2 has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-fd16481aa7bb24b1fd2abe029e60a8cf\" style=\"color:#1d1d1b;font-size:24px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Quem pode participar<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"Text2 has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-998bc9161b12017c2d62d1aabf83aa1d\" style=\"color:#565654;font-size:16px\">A NF-e, modelo 55, pode ser utilizada pelos contribuintes do Imposto sobre Opera\u00e7\u00f5es Relativas \u00e0 Circula\u00e7\u00e3o de Mercadorias e sobre a Presta\u00e7\u00e3o de Servi\u00e7os de Transporte Interestadual e Intermunicipal e de Comunica\u00e7\u00e3o (ICMS) em substitui\u00e7\u00e3o aos seguintes documentos:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"Text2 has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-f8aa5859add6657575993098fe6789fb\" style=\"color:#565654;font-size:16px\">Nota Fiscal modelo 1 ou 1-A.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"Text2 has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-47dc61b310479f4072cc2eb86ec551b6\" style=\"color:#565654;font-size:16px\">Nota Fiscal de Produtor modelo 4, excetuadas as opera\u00e7\u00f5es de sa\u00edda de gado bovino ou bubalino.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-leis-e-decretos leis-e-decretos\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"title\">Legisla\u00e7\u00e3o da NF-e<\/h2><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"card-leis-e-decretos\"><div class=\"thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/decretoicon.png\" alt=\"\"\/><\/div><div class=\"info\"><div class=\"text-content\"><div class=\"category-date\"><p class=\"category-item Portaria\">Portaria<\/p><p class=\"date\">2005-09-30<\/p><\/div><div class=\"descriptions\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">Ajuste SINIEF 07\/2005<\/h3><p class=\"card-description\">n\u00ba 07<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.confaz.fazenda.gov.br\/legislacao\/ajustes\/2005\/AJ007_05\" class=\"btn-access-doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Acessar<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"card-leis-e-decretos\"><div class=\"thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/decretoicon.png\" alt=\"\"\/><\/div><div class=\"info\"><div class=\"text-content\"><div class=\"category-date\"><p class=\"category-item Decretos\">Decretos<\/p><p class=\"date\">2008-02-29<\/p><\/div><div class=\"descriptions\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">Subanexo 12 ao Anexo 015<\/h3><p class=\"card-description\">N\u00ba 12<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/aacpdappls.net.ms.gov.br\/appls\/legislacao\/serc\/legato.nsf\/34248fea4d6a6d2a04256b210079ce20\/4fb6f8a822929d46042573fe004309e5?OpenDocument\" class=\"btn-access-doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Acessar<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"card-leis-e-decretos\"><div class=\"thumbnail\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/decretoicon.png\" alt=\"\"\/><\/div><div class=\"info\"><div class=\"text-content\"><div class=\"category-date\"><p class=\"category-item Portaria\">Portaria<\/p><p class=\"date\">2009-07-03<\/p><\/div><div class=\"descriptions\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">Protocolo ICMS 42\/2009<\/h3><p class=\"card-description\">N\u00ba 42<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.confaz.fazenda.gov.br\/legislacao\/protocolos\/2009\/pt042_09\" class=\"btn-access-doc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Acessar<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-about sobre\" style=\"background:#004f9f\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-12\"><div class=\"text-content\"><h2 class=\"dynamic-text-block-title\">Credenciamento<\/h2><p class=\"dynamic-text-block-description\"><p>Clique no bot\u00e3o abaixo para realizar o credenciamento online para emiss\u00e3o de NF-e<\/p><\/p><div class=\"list\"><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/ww2.dfe.ms.gov.br\/nfe-credenciamento\/index.jsf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"dynamic-link\">Credenciamento NF-e<\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"col-lg-6 col-12\"><div class=\"thumbnail\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7d22fa56bbdaff8eb0b02019b7318c96\" style=\"color:#30302e;font-size:32px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Informa\u00e7\u00f5es complementares<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-size:24px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Canais de atendimento<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1d97cdfc06d2a9642e136d9a8f9fbaec\" style=\"color:#004f9f;font-size:20px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.faleconosco.ms.gov.br\/faleconosco\/login\/login.jsf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Fale Conosco<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-95485643b03b611ca9376e38ab9d953e\" style=\"color:#004f9f;font-size:20px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.faleconosco.ms.gov.br\/faq\/#\/assunto\/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Perguntas Frequentes &#8211; SEFAZ MS<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a6e60ec3512cf9a510cf37d9deb77b1a\" style=\"color:#004f9f;font-size:20px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nfe.fazenda.gov.br\/portal\/perguntasFrequentes.aspx?tipoConteudo=3Ow1nfTBzIo=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Perguntas Frequentes &#8211; Portal Nacional da NF-e<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-container acordion-container\" id=\"acordion-0aa55063-c343-44bf-9f61-c01c9243575e\" data-title=\"Consultas\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Consulta da NF-e<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p>Consulte a chave de acesso da NF-e tanto em ambiente de homologa\u00e7\u00e3o quanto em ambiente de produ\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.dfe.ms.gov.br\/nfe\/consulta\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Consulte a chave de acesso da NF-e Portal Nacional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nfe.fazenda.gov.br\/portal\/consultaRecaptcha.aspx?tipoConsulta=resumo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Consulte numera\u00e7\u00e3o inutilizada tanto em ambiente de homologa\u00e7\u00e3o quanto em ambiente de produ\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"http:\/\/dfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/nfe\/inutilizacao\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p>Clique abaixo para ter acesso ao Portal Nacional da NF-e e verificar a documenta\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da NF-e (MOC, Schemas, Notas T\u00e9cnicas).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nfe.fazenda.gov.br\/portal\/listaSubMenu.aspx?Id=04BIflQt1aY=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar portal<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Empresas Credenciadas<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p>Verifique se sua empresa est\u00e1 credenciada para emiss\u00e3o de NF-e informando o CNPJ ou a Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Estadual.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.dfe.ms.gov.br\/nfe-credenciamento\/consultaCredenciado\/crud.jsf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Lista de Webservices<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p>Verifique aqui a lista de Webservices (ambientes de homologa\u00e7\u00e3o e produ\u00e7\u00e3o) para a emiss\u00e3o de NF-e.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Ambiente de Homologa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">TESTES \u2013 Sem valor fiscal<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>NfeInutilizacao (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeInutilizacao4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NfeConsultaProtocolo (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeConsultaProtocolo4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NfeStatusServi\u00e7o (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeStatusServico4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NfeConsultaCadastro (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/CadConsultaCadastro4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>RecepcaoEvento (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeRecepcaoEvento4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NFeAutoriza\u00e7\u00e3o (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeAutorizacao4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NFeRetAutoriza\u00e7\u00e3o (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/hom.nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeRetAutorizacao4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Ambiente de Produ\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>NfeInutilizacao (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeInutilizacao4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NfeConsultaProtocolo (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeConsultaProtocolo4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NfeStatusServi\u00e7o (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeStatusServico4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NfeConsultaCadastro (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/CadConsultaCadastro4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>RecepcaoEvento (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeRecepcaoEvento4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NFeAutoriza\u00e7\u00e3o (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeAutorizacao4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>NFeRetAutoriza\u00e7\u00e3o (vers\u00e3o 4.00)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>URL de conex\u00e3o: https:\/\/nfe.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/ws\/NFeRetAutorizacao4<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Outras consultas<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p>Consulta Disponibilidade de Documentos Fiscais Eletr\u00f4nicos<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/disponibilidade.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Consulta GTIN (Global Trade Item Number)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dfe-portal.svrs.rs.gov.br\/NFE\/Gtin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Consulta NCM (Nomenclatura Comum do Mercosul)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.rs.gov.br\/NFE\/NFE-WIZARD_NCM-CON.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Consulta Cadastro Centralizado de Contribuinte (CCC)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dfe-portal.svrs.rs.gov.br\/NFE\/CCC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar consulta<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Evento Pr\u00e9vio de Emiss\u00e3o em Conting\u00eancia (EPEC) Pendente<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nfe.fazenda.gov.br\/portal\/consultaEPECConciliacao.aspx?tipoConteudo=Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Acessar<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Formul\u00e1rio de Seguran\u00e7a<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p class=\"link-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ms.gov.br\/financas-e-impostos\/pedido-de-aquisicao-de-formulario-de-seguranca-pafs57\">Pedido de Aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de Formul\u00e1rio de Seguran\u00e7a (PAFS)<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-acordion-item acordion-item\"><h3 class=\"acordion-header\">Cadeia de Certificados<\/h3><div class=\"acordion-content\">\n<p>A SEFAZ\/MS informa que a cadeia de certificados ser\u00e1 atualizada em 18 de abril de 2024 e a nova Autoridade Certificadora de 1\u00b0 N\u00edvel ser\u00e1 a AC VALID SSL EV.<br>O Certificado ser\u00e1 renovado no servidor dos ambientes de homologa\u00e7\u00e3o e produ\u00e7\u00e3o para os seguintes documentos fiscais eletr\u00f4nicos:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Homologa\u00e7\u00e3o: NFC-e e NF3-e<br>Produ\u00e7\u00e3o: CT-e, NF-e e NFC-e<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As empresas que ainda n\u00e3o possuem a cadeia de certificados da AC VALID SSL EV instalada devem providenciar a sua instala\u00e7\u00e3o, contatando sua equipe t\u00e9cnica para adicionar a cadeia de certificados \u00e0 sua base de confian\u00e7a para que n\u00e3o ocorram problemas de autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o dos documentos acima descritos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Nova Cadeia<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"download-class\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/cadeias_certificados_2024.zip\">Download Cadeia Atualizada de Certificados da AC VALID SSL EV<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Em <strong>Homologa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>: vigente desde 04\/03\/2024<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Em <strong>Produ\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>: vigente a partir de 18\/04\/2024<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Manual de Orienta\u00e7\u00e3o para Atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"doc-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Instrucoes-para-baixar-arquivo-crt.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instru\u00e7\u00f5es para baixar arquivo CRT<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>O atendimento para d\u00favidas referentes a esse procedimento ser\u00e1 pelo Helpdesk no seguinte telefone: (67) 3318-3600.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Cadeia anterior:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"download-class\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/cadeias_certificados_2021.zip\">Download Cadeia Certificados 2021<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Em Homologa\u00e7\u00e3o: vigente desde 19\/03\/2021<br>Em Produ\u00e7\u00e3o: vigente a partir de 24\/05\/2021<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"doc-externo\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sefaz.ms.gov.br\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Manual-Cadeia-Certificados-2021.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Manual Cadeia Certificados 2021<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"container has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4699ff739be91e4a05a5d4263103e22d\" style=\"color:#30302e;font-size:32px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Not\u00edcias relacionadas a NF-e<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-noticias bloco-noticias-dinamico\" data-tipo=\"categoria\" data-termo=\"NF-e\" data-quantidade=\"4\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-custom-contato-do-programa contato-do-programa\"><div class=\"container\"><h2>Contato da NF-e<\/h2><div class=\"contato-do-programa-content\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"block-fild\"><div class=\"svg-fild\"><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 44 44\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\"><path d=\"M0 22C0 9.84974 9.84974 0 22 0C34.1503 0 44 9.84974 44 22C44 34.1503 34.1503 44 22 44C9.84974 44 0 34.1503 0 22Z\" fill=\"#EFEFEF\"><\/path><path d=\"M18.25 18.2812V16.7188C18.25 16.4844 18.4453 16.25 18.7188 16.25H20.2812C20.5156 16.25 20.75 16.4844 20.75 16.7188V18.2812C20.75 18.5547 20.5156 18.75 20.2812 18.75H18.7188C18.4453 18.75 18.25 18.5547 18.25 18.2812ZM23.7188 18.75C23.4453 18.75 23.25 18.5547 23.25 18.2812V16.7188C23.25 16.4844 23.4453 16.25 23.7188 16.25H25.2812C25.5156 16.25 25.75 16.4844 25.75 16.7188V18.2812C25.75 18.5547 25.5156 18.75 25.2812 18.75H23.7188ZM18.7188 22.5C18.4453 22.5 18.25 22.3047 18.25 22.0312V20.4688C18.25 20.2344 18.4453 20 18.7188 20H20.2812C20.5156 20 20.75 20.2344 20.75 20.4688V22.0312C20.75 22.3047 20.5156 22.5 20.2812 22.5H18.7188ZM23.7188 22.5C23.4453 22.5 23.25 22.3047 23.25 22.0312V20.4688C23.25 20.2344 23.4453 20 23.7188 20H